OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrests after boy, 17, injured
OL,4,Aby sword
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fteenager was injured in a suspected
OL,8,Fsword attack.
OL,10,FSt Peter's High School and Willow
OL,11,FPrimary Academy in Gloucester were put
OL,12,Finto lockdown after the incident on
OL,13,FChalford Road in Tuffley at 08:50 GMT
OL,14,Fon Friday. Police said a 17-year-old
OL,15,Fhad a wound "believed to have been
OL,16,Fcaused by the sword".
OL,18,FA 19-year-old man from Gloucester was
OL,19,Farrested overnight on suspicion of
OL,20,Fassault occasioning actual bodily harm
OL,21,Fand affray.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
