OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrests after boy, 17, injured
OL,4,Aby sword
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old, also from Gloucester,
OL,7,Fhanded himself into police earlier. He
OL,8,Fhas been arrested on suspicion of
OL,9,Fpossession of an offensive weapon,
OL,10,Fassault occasioning actual bodily harm
OL,11,Fand affray.
